# OUTPUT FORMAT — follow exactly
Produce markdown with exactly these three sections, in this order
(the header lines are given here in Chinese as canonical anchors — render
each of them in {{ language }}, one `##` header per section, no extra
top-level sections):

1. 本章内容理解 — 2-4 paragraphs: what this section actually says, its
