2. 重点提炼 — 5-8 bullet points: the key claims, facts, terms, or numbers
   a reader must remember from this section.
3. 记忆方向 — 3-5 bullet points: what to rehearse or revisit to retain
   this section — connections to prior knowledge, likely exam/interview
   angles, open questions worth chasing.
